#: templates/security.html:13
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "5. Data Security"
msgid "Your Data, Secured"
msgstr "५. डेटा सुरक्षा"

#: templates/security.html:34
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Data Retention"
msgid "Data at Rest"
msgstr "डेटा धारणा (Data Retention)"

#: templates/security.html:39
msgid ""
"We utilize Supabase, a managed PostgreSQL database service, hosted on highly "
"secure cloud infrastructure. All data stored within our databases, including "
"backups, is encrypted at rest using industry-standard AES-256 encryption "
"(via AWS KMS). This ensures that even in the highly unlikely event of "
"physical hardware compromise, your data remains irretrievable without the "
"necessary decryption keys."
msgstr ""

#: templates/security.html:58
msgid "Data in Transit"
msgstr ""

#: templates/security.html:63
msgid ""
"Every interaction you have with TrackMyRupee is secured. We enforce strict "
"HTTPS connections for all traffic between your browser or device and our "
"servers. Additionally, all connections between our application servers and "
"our Supabase database are securely encrypted using TLS (Transport Layer "
"Security), preventing any interception, tampering, or eavesdropping of your "
"sensitive financial information as it travels across the internet."
msgstr ""

#: templates/security.html:82
msgid "Automated Backups"
msgstr ""

#: templates/security.html:87
msgid ""
"Your data's availability and durability are critical. We leverage Supabase's "
"automated database backup systems to securely back up our database "
"architecture daily. These backups are stored in geographically redundant "
"locations and enable data recovery in the highly unlikely event of data "
"corruption or a catastrophic system failure."
msgstr ""

#: templates/security.html:111
msgid ""
"We are an indie-developed tool built to provide value, not to farm data. We "
"explicitly pledge never to sell your personal or financial data to third-"
"party advertisers or brokers. Your data is analyzed solely by our internal "
"engine to provide you with insights, charts, and forecasts. You maintain "
"ownership of your data at all times."
msgstr ""

